@* Naascar 3D project detail *@
<link rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/css/project.css")" />
<div class="project project-detail">
    <h2 class="detail-title">Naascar 3D</h2>
    <partial name="_ProjectCarousel" model="@("naascar_3d")" />
    <div class="detail-description">
        <div class="project-text">
            <p>The Second project in this course was a 3D game. I had to recreate the engine, but decided to continue with the racing idea, and thus Naascar 3D was born. This time implementing a ghost car that drives smoothly through the course with the player using Bezier curve calculations. I also created a DFS algorithm to auto-generate a new track for every game. Im increadibly proud of this one, although the lighting could be a bit better.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <partial name="_ProjectGallery" model="@("naascar_3d")" />
</div>
